&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
